WEBVTT

01:35.570 --> 01:40.410
THE SINGING KING CRAB

01:35.620 --> 01:38.550
We've got more people with us this time.

01:38.550 --> 01:40.410
It was for the best. Right, Yamoto-san?

01:40.840 --> 01:43.220
It's like SAIŌ's horse!

01:40.840 --> 01:43.220
NOTE: SAIŌ's horse turned bad luck into good luck.

01:43.220 --> 01:44.240
What a cute saying!

01:44.240 --> 01:45.460
So cute!

01:48.460 --> 01:50.620
You're pushing it too much, Yamoto-san!

01:50.620 --> 01:52.570
You'll end up ordering a lot!

01:52.570 --> 01:54.380
I didn't hear the sound, so...

01:54.380 --> 01:55.760
Okay, I'll join in!

01:56.760 --> 01:58.730
IYO!

01:56.760 --> 01:58.730
NOTE: IYO is the sound KABUKI makes.

02:05.790 --> 02:09.770
LAST GIRL STANDING

02:09.770 --> 02:12.270
Love Retinue

02:10.730 --> 02:12.270
I'm next!

02:12.660 --> 02:15.330
I can't find any songs I want to sing...

02:15.330 --> 02:16.580
You're right.

02:20.220 --> 02:21.820
Just a sec. I need to use the restroom.

02:24.620 --> 02:25.410
DŌMO.

02:26.150 --> 02:27.910
I am Shōgo.

02:28.240 --> 02:30.420
DŌMO. I am Yamoto.

02:30.970 --> 02:32.800
You've come for me, right?

02:32.800 --> 02:34.110
Yes.

02:34.110 --> 02:35.600
You can tell, can't you?

02:35.600 --> 02:37.840
I couldn't.

02:37.840 --> 02:39.090
What do you mean?

02:40.400 --> 02:43.440
I can't believe that you became a NINJA, too.

02:43.440 --> 02:45.000
I just wanted to...

02:45.000 --> 02:47.020
BING! Fifth floor!

02:47.020 --> 02:48.040
BUDDHAFUCK!

02:48.040 --> 02:49.390
I'm out of time?

02:49.390 --> 02:52.310
Try to understand as much of this as you can.

02:52.310 --> 02:53.900
I turned into a NINJA!

02:53.900 --> 02:57.110
And on that day, the SŌKAIYA SYNDICATE made me join them!

02:57.110 --> 02:58.530
You can't turn them down!

02:58.530 --> 03:00.530
You either join them or die!

03:03.530 --> 03:07.370
They know you're a NINJA,
and they're coming after you.

03:07.370 --> 03:09.370
Suicide!

03:09.640 --> 03:11.860
You're not like me.

03:11.860 --> 03:13.730
Suicide-SAN!

03:13.730 --> 03:17.380
I got sick of waiting, and I'm falling asleep!

03:18.950 --> 03:22.220
Oh, there you are, Suicide.

03:22.220 --> 03:24.100
That's the girl.

03:24.660 --> 03:27.480
DŌMO, Yamoto Koki-SAN.

03:27.480 --> 03:31.690
I'm a NINJA of the SŌKAI SIX GATES, Sonic Boom.

03:32.040 --> 03:35.170
The boy with the afro is Suicide.
He works for me.

03:35.170 --> 03:36.150
Nice to meet you.

03:36.550 --> 03:39.570
I've come to get you and turn you into a real NINJA...

03:39.570 --> 03:43.240
A SŌKAIYA NINJA.

03:43.780 --> 03:46.150
Don't be scared.

03:46.150 --> 03:47.910
Take Suicide, for instance.

03:47.910 --> 03:52.330
Thanks to the SYNDICATE,
now he's good for something.

03:52.330 --> 03:55.840
I'm giving you the same chance.

03:56.220 --> 03:58.060
To contribute to society!

03:59.010 --> 04:01.840
You understand? Eh?

04:02.260 --> 04:03.840
Even someone like you...

04:03.840 --> 04:06.100
who killed her own parents.

04:13.150 --> 04:15.910
You have no reason to refuse, right?

04:15.910 --> 04:17.730
If you do, I'll kill you.

04:17.730 --> 04:22.450
But I'll be sure to have some fun with you first.

04:23.330 --> 04:24.490
Yamoto-SAN.

04:24.820 --> 04:26.490
I just wanted to apologize to you.

04:27.220 --> 04:28.030
This is my fault...

04:28.570 --> 04:29.700
I'm sorry.

04:30.700 --> 04:31.480
YEEART!

04:31.480 --> 04:33.040
The hell?

04:33.040 --> 04:34.670
Suicide, you bastard!

04:34.670 --> 04:36.710
Go! I'll handle him!

04:37.310 --> 04:38.290
YEEART!

04:38.290 --> 04:39.300
UWAAARRGGH!

04:39.880 --> 04:41.640
So you've started to learn the ropes, huh?

04:41.640 --> 04:42.350
YEEART!

04:42.350 --> 04:43.350
UWAAARRGGH!

04:43.350 --> 04:44.630
I dunno how long I can hold him!

04:44.630 --> 04:45.710
Go!

04:49.260 --> 04:55.650
THE SINGING KING CRAB

04:56.930 --> 04:59.610
You're not like me.

05:00.130 --> 05:01.930
You have friends...

05:01.930 --> 05:03.110
So don't do it!

05:04.600 --> 05:07.990
Being a SŌKAIYA NINJA is a real shitty job.

05:08.420 --> 05:10.000
Shōgo-SAN...

05:12.040 --> 05:13.680
Run. All of you.

05:13.680 --> 05:15.120
What about Shōgo-san?

05:16.910 --> 05:19.510
Run. Leave it to me.

05:19.510 --> 05:20.290
But...

05:21.000 --> 05:23.240
It's okay. I'll see you tomorrow.

05:32.600 --> 05:34.310
You didn't run?

05:34.310 --> 05:36.100
You've got guts, kiddo!

05:36.640 --> 05:39.200
You wanna fight, eh?

05:44.370 --> 05:46.950
DŌMO, Sonic Boom-SAN.

05:48.950 --> 05:50.580
I am Yamoto Koki.

05:56.130 --> 05:57.860
A psychic?

05:57.860 --> 05:59.750
Not bad for a goddamn kid.

05:59.750 --> 06:02.960
But there are plenty of psychic NINJAS.

06:02.960 --> 06:08.110
Now, as ever, the best NINJAS are the ones who have the best KARATE.

06:08.110 --> 06:10.850
I'll teach you a lesson in pain.

06:11.200 --> 06:12.720
Just try.

06:16.000 --> 06:17.440
How stupid.

06:17.900 --> 06:18.690
Get him!

06:21.040 --> 06:22.800
Screw you, bitch!

06:23.910 --> 06:27.820
Both you and Suicide are named ARCHNINJAS?

06:27.820 --> 06:29.580
Fuck you!

06:31.780 --> 06:34.310
Don't mess with your elders, kid!

06:34.310 --> 06:36.080
NAMU AMIDA BUTSU!

06:36.080 --> 06:38.110
Screw you, bitch!

06:38.110 --> 06:42.130
That was the signal for the CLONE YAKUZA nearby to attack!

06:38.110 --> 06:42.130
NOTE: CLONE YAKUZA come from YAKUZA VATS.

06:42.130 --> 06:43.920
Screw you, bitch!

06:44.480 --> 06:45.920
YEEART!

06:45.920 --> 06:47.920
UWAAARRGGH!

06:52.520 --> 06:53.400
YEEART!

06:53.400 --> 06:55.550
IEYAAAAAA!

06:58.910 --> 07:01.750
This is the difference in our KARATE.

07:02.970 --> 07:06.110
A parricidal bitch like you, engaging in YŪJŌ?

07:06.110 --> 07:08.420
Don't make me laugh.

07:08.420 --> 07:13.660
The only life for a little bitch like you is with SŌKAIYA.

07:13.660 --> 07:14.780
Got it?

07:15.150 --> 07:17.970
Apologize for what you did.

07:17.970 --> 07:20.370
For what you're hiding from your friends!

07:20.370 --> 07:22.210
N-No!

07:29.680 --> 07:31.690
I don't like you.

07:33.020 --> 07:36.350
You're going to suffer before you die.

07:38.170 --> 07:39.430
Knock off that slurping!

07:42.130 --> 07:42.940
You're—

07:43.400 --> 07:46.770
DŌMO, HAJIMEMASHITE, Sonic Boom-SAN.

07:46.770 --> 07:48.650
I am NINJA Slayer.

07:54.280 --> 07:56.660
I see a man can't even eat in peace here.

07:56.930 --> 07:58.210
Tsk.

07:58.210 --> 08:00.790
DŌMO, NINJA Slayer-SAN.

08:01.220 --> 08:02.750
What are you doing here?

08:02.750 --> 08:04.170
How do you know who I am?

08:04.750 --> 08:08.280
My eyes are upon SŌKAIYA at all times!

08:08.280 --> 08:13.010
Amid this chaos, you dare ask why I'm here? What a fool!

08:13.010 --> 08:16.040
Sonic Boom, of the SŌKAI SIX GATES!

08:16.040 --> 08:17.910
He who wields SONIC KARATE.

08:16.040 --> 08:17.910
NOTE: SONIC KARATE is the art of CHARGE MOVES.

08:17.910 --> 08:19.110
A talent scout.

08:19.110 --> 08:20.860
His NINJA clothes are made with golden thread.

08:20.860 --> 08:22.150
His taste is awful.

08:22.150 --> 08:23.420
You bastard—

08:23.420 --> 08:27.020
You're one of the names written in the catalog of targets.

08:27.020 --> 08:28.710
NINJA must be slain!

08:28.710 --> 08:31.400
Don't think you'll make it out of here alive.

08:31.400 --> 08:35.910
I'll break your face with my SONIC KARATE!

08:36.400 --> 08:37.660
Give it a try.

08:37.660 --> 08:39.150
YEEART!

08:41.020 --> 08:42.310
Die, motherfucker!

08:42.310 --> 08:43.110
YEEART!

08:45.080 --> 08:46.750
Screw you!

08:46.750 --> 08:48.000
Behold!

08:48.000 --> 08:50.550
SONIC KARATE's anti-air technique, the Bomb-Bomb Punch!

08:50.550 --> 08:52.420
Screw you, asshole!

08:52.420 --> 08:56.280
Like the SHŌRINJI WOODEN MEN,
they attack at extremely close range!

08:52.420 --> 08:56.280
NOTE: SHŌRINJI WOODEN MEN stars JACKIE CHAN.

08:56.280 --> 09:00.350
They are a cosmos unto themselves,
one of the lightning-fast punches and blocks!

09:00.350 --> 09:01.970
YEEART!

09:02.390 --> 09:03.970
UWAAARRGGH!

09:03.970 --> 09:05.750
Screw you, asshole!

09:05.750 --> 09:07.560
YEEART!

09:08.810 --> 09:10.510
UWAAARRGGH!

09:12.440 --> 09:13.440
YEEART!

09:13.440 --> 09:18.880
The HAIKU of ancient JAPAN says that with many shots, one may strike their target.

09:18.880 --> 09:21.290
But reality says otherwise!

09:21.290 --> 09:22.710
Why?

09:22.710 --> 09:24.040
Why can't I hit you?

09:24.040 --> 09:26.210
GUUUWAGGHH!

09:26.210 --> 09:28.540
Because the battle is already over!

09:28.950 --> 09:31.250
Read your HAIKU, Sonic Boom-SAN!

09:31.250 --> 09:33.020
Screw you!

09:33.020 --> 09:34.920
Screw you, asshole!

09:56.170 --> 09:57.860
What the hell is that!?

09:58.910 --> 10:00.750
That's no ORIGAMI...

10:03.060 --> 10:04.870
Screw you, bitch!

10:07.550 --> 10:09.130
YEEART!

10:11.600 --> 10:12.880
UWAAARRGGH!

10:32.930 --> 10:34.240
Go!

10:34.900 --> 10:37.330
SAYŌNARA!

10:41.750 --> 10:43.910
DŌMO. I am NINJA Slayer.

10:44.370 --> 10:47.480
DŌMO, NINJA Slayer-SAN.

10:47.480 --> 10:48.750
I am Yamoto Koki.

10:49.350 --> 10:51.960
Did you do all this by yourself?

10:52.480 --> 10:54.200
I did.

10:54.200 --> 10:55.800
They attacked me first.

10:55.800 --> 10:56.730
But...

10:56.730 --> 10:57.800
I can fight no longer.

10:57.800 --> 10:59.300
So it seems.

11:00.300 --> 11:02.820
Kill her, Fujikido!

11:02.820 --> 11:06.400
She is possessed by DEATH NINJA.

11:06.400 --> 11:11.420
She is exhausted, so slaying her could not be easier!

11:11.420 --> 11:13.710
Have your revenge!

11:13.710 --> 11:14.530
Silence!

11:14.530 --> 11:16.730
You are mistaken!

11:16.730 --> 11:20.970
I am fulfilling my own goals,
not your greedy desire!

11:20.970 --> 11:23.200
Do not disappoint me!

11:23.200 --> 11:25.950
Slay all NINJAS!

11:34.370 --> 11:35.170
Go!

11:41.010 --> 11:43.010
Several Days Later

11:53.110 --> 11:54.770
Aiee!

11:55.220 --> 11:56.270
Yamoto-san!

11:56.600 --> 11:58.640
You're alive!

11:58.640 --> 12:00.530
I'm sorry I couldn't come sooner.

12:03.060 --> 12:07.120
If I stay, I'll cause more problems for you.

12:07.860 --> 12:09.250
Like at the karaoke place.

12:10.130 --> 12:13.500
So I can't ever... be with you again.

12:20.710 --> 12:23.010
Is this goodbye? Forever?

12:23.460 --> 12:25.400
If something happens to you, Asari-SAN,

12:25.400 --> 12:27.430
I'll be there, no matter what.

12:32.750 --> 12:33.890
SAYŌNARA.

12:35.080 --> 12:36.180
YŪJŌ.

12:35.080 --> 12:36.180
NOTE: YŪJŌ is...

12:37.200 --> 12:38.480
YŪJŌ!

12:37.200 --> 12:38.480
NOTE: ...NINJA friendship.

12:42.600 --> 12:43.730
Yeeart!
